  "description": "Password policy vectors shared by internal/credential/policy.go (policy_vectors_test.go) and web/src/lib/passwordPolicy.ts (web/unit/passwordPolicy.test.ts). reason is empty for an accepted password, otherwise one of: too_short, too_long, control_character, weak, contains_username, common.",
